cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or dataset, please cite the accompanying manuscript and this repository."
title: "SCAA: decoder-guided cross-axis attention for assembly sealing interface morphology inversion"
abstract: "Reference implementation and prepared finite element dataset for morphology inversion of assembly sealing interfaces. The repository contains the PyTorch training, evaluation and screening code for the SCAA and reference field-prediction networks, 891 prepared finite element cases on a 224 by 224 polar grid with reference morphologies at 570 interface nodes, the fixed 712/89/90 case split, the original run configurations for seeds 2085, 4125 and 8012, and the recorded training curves."
type: software
